WEBVTT

00:07.170 --> 00:08.960
<b>Hijiri-san! That way!</b>

00:08.960 --> 00:10.830
<b>Which way's "that way"?!</b>

00:10.830 --> 00:12.080
<b>One meter to our left!</b>

00:14.000 --> 00:15.130
<b>There's Yamato!</b>

00:15.290 --> 00:16.330
<b>Pull tight!</b>

00:18.880 --> 00:19.920
<b>Ow!</b>

00:20.630 --> 00:22.290
<b>Was everything okay?</b>

00:22.290 --> 00:23.170
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:23.630 --> 00:26.290
<b>See, the iguana's safe and sound!</b>

00:26.290 --> 00:27.170
<b>Good.</b>

00:27.500 --> 00:28.710
<b>Are you all right?</b>

00:28.710 --> 00:30.080
<b>Y-yeah.</b>

00:30.290 --> 00:32.080
<b>But I'm not sure about Nakamura-kun...</b>

00:32.750 --> 00:35.960
<b>Wh-what happened, Black? Are you okay, Black?</b>

00:33.380 --> 00:36.880
<b>Hey, is he all right? You think he needs CPR?</b>

00:33.500 --> 00:36.880
<b>Uh... Are you okay? Hello?</b>

00:33.880 --> 00:36.540
<b>Video</b>

00:35.960 --> 00:37.540
<b>Who did this to you?!</b>

00:35.960 --> 00:36.880
<b>Is he okay?</b>

00:37.790 --> 00:39.000
<b>Black!</b>

00:54.290 --> 00:56.670
<b>That's right, I have awakened</b>

00:56.670 --> 00:59.500
<b>I posses a special power</b>

00:59.500 --> 01:01.670
<b>Before this barrier of mine</b>

01:01.670 --> 01:06.170
<b>All are powerless</b>

01:09.250 --> 01:11.960
<b>Perhaps the reincarnation of an angel or a devil</b>

01:11.960 --> 01:14.750
<b>I can see the unseen</b>

01:14.750 --> 01:16.960
<b>My right arm is throbbing</b>

01:16.960 --> 01:19.330
<b>But I can't unleash it yet</b>

01:19.460 --> 01:22.130
<b>Neither a kid nor an adult</b>

01:22.130 --> 01:24.460
<b>Bust open some philosophy piercings</b>

01:24.460 --> 01:28.250
<b>Cassis orange, fried chicken, squeeze some lemon on and go!</b>

01:28.540 --> 01:30.830
<b>(Drink, drink, drink, drink it up!)</b>

01:31.000 --> 01:33.330
<b>I've got a complication, there's a fanfare in my head</b>

01:33.330 --> 01:35.830
<b>Mingled in the darkness of solitude and twisted logic</b>

01:35.830 --> 01:38.420
<b>I can't find a proper remedy</b>

01:38.420 --> 01:40.790
<b>It's the destiny of those born as men</b>

01:40.790 --> 01:43.580
<b>I've got to discover my true self</b>

01:43.580 --> 01:46.130
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

01:46.130 --> 01:48.540
<b>I've got a complication, there's a fanfare in my head</b>

01:48.540 --> 01:51.000
<b>Swaying in the gap between ideals and reality</b>

01:51.000 --> 01:53.580
<b>I don't see a solution</b>

01:53.580 --> 01:56.130
<b>If it's my fate to live for the moment</b>

01:56.130 --> 01:58.750
<b>I've got to discover my true self</b>

01:58.920 --> 02:01.250
<b>Go Forth and Illuminate, Searchlight!</b>

02:01.250 --> 02:03.830
<b>Eternal Force Blizzard!</b>

02:11.380 --> 02:13.830
<b>All we needed to do was find a lost iguana.</b>

02:11.830 --> 02:14.420
<b>Episode 7</b>

02:11.830 --> 02:14.420
<b>I'm No Pretty Boy and It's a One Night Stand</b>

02:13.830 --> 02:16.250
<b>How did things get that crazy?</b>

02:17.790 --> 02:19.540
<b>That sounds rough.</b>

02:19.920 --> 02:24.580
<b>Though seeing how happy people are afterwards
does encourage me to keep at it.</b>

02:25.130 --> 02:26.960
<b>Sounds like fun.</b>

02:26.960 --> 02:28.540
<b>Huh?! Not at all!</b>

02:28.790 --> 02:33.250
<b>Oh, really? You go to the clubroom everyday,
so I thought you were having fun.</b>

02:33.250 --> 02:36.790
<b>Huh?! Well, I guess despite everything,</b>

02:34.750 --> 02:46.380
<b>Hero Club!</b>

02:36.960 --> 02:42.580
<b>the tea Nakamura-kun serves is good,
and I'd hate to miss the sweets Mikuriya-kun brings...</b>

02:42.960 --> 02:46.420
<b>Wait. I guess I don't hate it as much anymore...?</b>

02:46.420 --> 02:47.540
<b>No, no, no, no, no, no, no!</b>

02:49.750 --> 02:52.290
<b>I want to lead my school life in peace!</b>

02:53.250 --> 02:54.460
<b>I see!</b>

02:59.290 --> 03:01.250
<b>Student Council Room</b>

03:00.130 --> 03:03.750
<b>Why... did they call me here?</b>

03:04.960 --> 03:07.330
<b>I don't like the look of this...</b>

03:08.080 --> 03:10.330
<b>Do you get what we mean?</b>

03:10.330 --> 03:13.790
<b>President                                 Vice President                                  Secretary</b>

03:10.540 --> 03:15.920
<b>Um, so you're saying...
that there's a problem with the Hero Club?</b>

03:16.540 --> 03:20.830
<b>Well, lately we've been getting questions
from the general public.</b>

03:21.540 --> 03:23.830
<b>This is the Hero Club, correct?</b>

03:23.830 --> 03:26.330
<b>Um... Yes...</b>

03:26.540 --> 03:29.880
<b>If this was within school grounds, we would have let it go,</b>

03:29.880 --> 03:33.420
<b>but making trouble outside
affects the school's reputation.</b>

03:33.630 --> 03:37.380
<b>It causes problems for
the honest students who are working hard.</b>

03:38.130 --> 03:40.580
<b>I'm sorry about that, but...</b>

03:40.580 --> 03:41.330
<b>"But"?</b>

03:41.710 --> 03:45.460
<b>I think you might have the wrong idea
about these two photos, at least...</b>

03:46.000 --> 03:49.960
<b>This one was to help out a friend
who had a stalker after her,</b>

03:49.960 --> 03:52.290
<b>and this one was for a lost parakeet...</b>

03:52.290 --> 03:57.170
<b>Uh... the sound... recalls memories from a past life...</b>

03:57.170 --> 04:03.210
<b>I think, uh, banging the three pots was supposed
to bring the bird back, or something... Or not?</b>

04:03.830 --> 04:07.170
<b>It's no good. I don't even believe what I'm saying...</b>

04:09.250 --> 04:11.130
<b>I sympathize with what you're dealing with.</b>

04:11.460 --> 04:13.500
<b>But that's a different issue altogether.</b>

04:13.500 --> 04:15.880
<b>Any more trouble from the Hero Club, and...</b>

04:16.130 --> 04:17.540
<b>...you'll get rid of the club?!</b>

04:17.540 --> 04:19.790
<b>We don't have the authority to do that.</b>

04:20.170 --> 04:24.330
<b>Besides, the Hero Club isn't recognized
as a proper club to begin with.</b>

04:24.330 --> 04:25.380
<b>Huh?</b>

04:25.670 --> 04:27.250
<b>It's not a club?!</b>

04:27.250 --> 04:31.250
<b>The place they call their clubroom is just
a space they're using without permission.</b>

04:31.630 --> 04:33.080
<b>What...?</b>

04:33.080 --> 04:34.920
<b>They're hopeless!</b>

04:35.170 --> 04:40.790
<b>Honestly speaking, the Hero Club is nothing but trouble.</b>

04:43.130 --> 04:45.920
<b>Huh? Did I just get annoyed?</b>

04:45.920 --> 04:51.420
<b>Our role is to ensure that our students
get to lead their school lives in peace.</b>

04:51.750 --> 04:55.460
<b>Wouldn't you want to lead
your days in peace too, Hijiri-san?</b>

04:55.460 --> 04:56.630
<b>I do!</b>

04:57.290 --> 05:00.960
<b>Oh, good! We actually have a favor to ask you.</b>

05:01.540 --> 05:03.290
<b>"A favor"?</b>

05:03.710 --> 05:07.080
<b>Yes. Minakami High School's
cultural festival is coming up.</b>

05:07.330 --> 05:10.420
<b>Obviously, we'll be having plenty of outside guests.</b>

05:10.670 --> 05:14.080
<b>If the Hero Club were to cause problems there...</b>

05:14.580 --> 05:16.830
<b>I'll do what it takes to stop that from happening!</b>

05:18.250 --> 05:20.500
<b>Thank you so much for your cooperation.</b>

05:20.500 --> 05:22.960
<b>Just until the end of the festival, for now.</b>

05:22.960 --> 05:25.920
<b>Punishment</b>

05:23.210 --> 05:25.960
<b>If the club causes problems during that time...</b>

05:26.540 --> 05:28.080
<b>I assume you understand?</b>

05:31.630 --> 05:35.630
<b>Let's hope this will keep the Hero Club restrained...</b>

05:40.630 --> 05:43.130
<b>Why would I go and say something like that?</b>

05:43.460 --> 05:45.540
<b>"I'll do what it takes," huh?</b>

05:46.130 --> 05:50.960
<b>They helped me when I was about
to get crushed by that basketball hoop...</b>

05:52.830 --> 05:57.420
<b>...and I got to be friends with Nanako-chan because
they helped save her from Sekiya-senpai.</b>

05:59.920 --> 06:02.580
<b>If the Hero Club is disbanded...</b>

06:06.210 --> 06:07.920
<b>It doesn't fit...</b>

06:10.500 --> 06:15.500
<b>Valid anytime, anywhere!</b>

06:10.500 --> 06:15.500
<b>Hero Ticket</b>

06:11.080 --> 06:14.080
<b>"Hero Ticket, valid anytime, anywhere," huh?</b>

06:14.290 --> 06:15.540
<b>That's right...</b>

06:16.380 --> 06:18.460
<b>Use this when you need it!</b>

06:19.250 --> 06:20.920
<b>He did say that.</b>

06:24.920 --> 06:26.040
<b>All right!</b>

06:26.040 --> 06:28.670
<b>Valid anytime, anywhere!</b>

06:26.040 --> 06:28.670
<b>Hero Ticket</b>

06:30.710 --> 06:33.170
<b>It never hurts to be prepared</b>

06:30.710 --> 06:33.170
<b>Toga Ryushoin</b>

06:30.960 --> 06:36.000
<b>From now on, I want you to entrust
the Hero Club's operations to me!</b>

06:36.630 --> 06:38.250
<b>Wow, this is unexpected.</b>

06:38.250 --> 06:40.170
<b>What's gotten into you?</b>

06:40.420 --> 06:44.000
<b>Pink's finally gotten serious, huh?! I'm so happy!</b>

06:44.420 --> 06:46.040
<b>I'm not Pink, though.</b>

06:46.540 --> 06:48.630
<b>What do you intend to do, exactly?</b>

06:49.250 --> 06:54.210
<b>Usually, we all tackle one thing together,
but that's not very efficient, right?</b>

06:54.540 --> 06:57.580
<b>We wouldn't be the Hero Club
if we didn't put all of our powers together!</b>

06:57.790 --> 07:04.130
<b>But if the appropriate members work on each job,
we can help a lot more people out!</b>

07:05.710 --> 07:07.670
<b>Noda-kun's interested! This might work!</b>

07:07.670 --> 07:10.130
<b>Takashima-kun, what kind of requests
do we have at the moment?</b>

07:10.670 --> 07:12.130
<b>Let's see...</b>

07:12.130 --> 07:16.580
<b>• Help harvest potatoes</b>

07:12.130 --> 07:16.580
<b>• Field in the fifth district</b>

07:12.130 --> 07:16.580
<b>• Not enough hands</b>

07:12.380 --> 07:16.630
<b>Digging up potatoes at a field in the fifth district.
They need more hands, apparently.</b>

07:16.830 --> 07:18.420
<b>Tsukumo-kun, can you get that?</b>

07:18.420 --> 07:19.540
<b>Huh? Me?</b>

07:19.960 --> 07:23.920
<b>Housework is your specialty.
You must know how to handle potatoes!</b>

07:25.080 --> 07:26.170
<b>If you say so.</b>

07:26.170 --> 07:31.670
<b>Talking poodles on a two-hour walk. The owner guy
sprained his ankle, so we need to take over.</b>

07:26.170 --> 07:31.630
<b>• Walking poodles</b>

07:26.170 --> 07:31.630
<b>• Two-hour course</b>

07:26.170 --> 07:31.630
<b>• Take care of your leg, old man</b>

07:26.170 --> 07:31.630
<b>• Help shopping</b>

07:26.170 --> 07:31.630
<b>DONE</b>

07:26.170 --> 07:31.630
<b>• For lady from third district</b>

07:26.170 --> 07:31.630
<b>barber shop</b>

07:26.170 --> 07:31.630
<b>• Carrots, mince, and milk</b>

07:31.960 --> 07:33.290
<b>That's yours, Takashima-kun.</b>

07:33.290 --> 07:36.330
<b>Uh?! H-he said there's eight of them, though...</b>

07:36.330 --> 07:38.670
<b>Just imagine they belong to Sora-chan!</b>

07:40.290 --> 07:44.130
<b>Sora-chan's a cat person,
but last week's episode had a poodle in it,</b>

07:44.130 --> 07:48.580
<b>so I feel like fate might have brought me this job,
kinda, sorta, maybe?!</b>

07:48.580 --> 07:50.540
<b>Takashima. Snap out of it.</b>

07:50.540 --> 07:52.000
<b>Huh? What were we talking about, again?</b>

07:52.000 --> 07:53.670
<b>About job requests.</b>

07:53.670 --> 07:58.710
<b>Oh, right. Some 2nd-year upperclassmen
want help getting out of extra classes.</b>

07:59.080 --> 08:01.330
<b>They just need help studying?</b>

08:01.330 --> 08:02.710
<b>Seems that way.</b>

08:02.960 --> 08:07.460
<b>Then I think Nakamura-kun and Mikuriya-kun
are right for the job, but they're 2nd-years, right?</b>

08:07.460 --> 08:10.830
<b>Not a problem. I can take it on, whatever the subject.</b>

08:10.830 --> 08:12.830
<b>No wonder you're the top student in our grade.</b>

08:13.210 --> 08:15.210
<b>I've got 3rd-year material down, too.</b>

08:15.210 --> 08:16.210
<b>Seriously?!</b>

08:16.630 --> 08:19.460
<b>We also need someone to play
the taiko drum at a fall festival.</b>

08:19.460 --> 08:21.830
<b>Oh! Me, me! Let me do that!</b>

08:22.830 --> 08:26.880
<b>This is bad... I have the feeling
that will lead to huge trouble.</b>

08:27.460 --> 08:30.960
<b>Um, maybe I'll get you to dig potatoes
after all, Noda-kun!</b>

08:31.250 --> 08:33.460
<b>But Purple's got the potatoes, right?</b>

08:33.960 --> 08:36.290
<b>Y-yeah, but...</b>

08:36.830 --> 08:37.710
<b>Right.</b>

08:38.000 --> 08:38.920
<b>Look!</b>

08:39.330 --> 08:41.250
<b>C-could those be...?!</b>

08:42.040 --> 08:44.960
<b>That's right. Hero Tickets!</b>

08:43.000 --> 08:45.210
<b>Valid anytime, anywhere!</b>

08:43.000 --> 08:45.210
<b>Hero Ticket</b>

08:45.790 --> 08:48.500
<b>"Hero Tickets"? Sounds interesting.</b>

08:48.500 --> 08:52.500
<b>Indeed, although that's
the sole pack currently in existence.</b>

08:53.790 --> 08:56.380
<b>It means you'll do whatever I need help with, right?</b>

08:57.170 --> 09:00.000
<b>Yup. A man never goes back on his word!</b>

09:00.330 --> 09:02.580
<b>Then you've got potato digging, Noda-kun!</b>

09:03.540 --> 09:09.170
<b>Then can I ask you to play the festival drum,
Tsukumo-kun? You look like you've got rhythm.</b>

09:10.210 --> 09:14.630
<b>Leave it to me. I'll make the audience
swoon with my drumstick skills.</b>

09:22.250 --> 09:25.210
<b>I just need to imagine these are
toy poodles a tenth of their size,</b>

09:25.210 --> 09:30.920
<b>and they're exactly like the dog owned by
the lady living next to Sora-chan, kinda, sorta, maybe...?!</b>

09:35.420 --> 09:37.750
<b>Sounds like Tsukumo's working hard.</b>

09:38.540 --> 09:43.380
<b>And a heave, ho-tatoes!</b>

09:44.290 --> 09:45.500
<b>Yah!</b>

09:45.880 --> 09:47.170
<b>Wow!</b>

09:47.790 --> 09:53.170
<b>Who would've thought training for the "Let 'er rip!
Tug of war" would come in handy here!</b>

09:53.170 --> 09:54.500
<b>Good work!</b>

09:54.880 --> 09:57.670
<b>Take home as many sweet potatoes as you want!</b>

09:58.790 --> 10:01.630
<b>There are four things you must remember about this era.</b>

10:02.170 --> 10:07.000
<b>The Holy Roman Empire</b>

10:02.170 --> 10:07.000
<b>The Knights of Darkness</b>

10:02.170 --> 10:07.000
<b>The Lost Ark                                The Knights Templar</b>

10:03.130 --> 10:07.380
<b>The Holy Roman Empire!
The Knights Templar! The Lost Ark!</b>

10:07.710 --> 10:08.540
<b>And...</b>

10:10.460 --> 10:11.960
<b>...the Knights of Darkness.</b>

10:11.960 --> 10:14.960
<b>The Knights...of Darkness?</b>

10:15.380 --> 10:18.380
<b>Many ages ago... I was there as well.</b>

10:20.830 --> 10:22.460
<b>Isn't this supposed to be world history?</b>

10:22.460 --> 10:24.960
<b>Are the Knights of Darkness gonna be on the test?</b>

10:26.750 --> 10:27.960
<b>No, they won't.</b>

10:27.960 --> 10:29.460
<b>What?!</b>

10:31.250 --> 10:35.960
<b>The problem looks tricky at first glance,
but it can be solved in one step using this equation.</b>

10:35.960 --> 10:37.290
<b>Memorize it in two seconds.</b>

10:37.830 --> 10:39.460
<b>That's impossible!</b>

10:39.460 --> 10:43.040
<b>This is an equation you learned your first year.
Two seconds is lenient enough-</b>

10:44.830 --> 10:45.880
<b>What's this?</b>

10:46.960 --> 10:49.250
<b>This sensation... Don't tell me...?!</b>

10:49.960 --> 10:53.750
<b>S-settle down, right arm...!</b>

10:54.750 --> 10:56.210
<b>What's going on?</b>

10:56.830 --> 11:00.250
<b>I can't... unleash you yet...!</b>

11:00.790 --> 11:03.170
<b>The time has come!</b>

11:04.170 --> 11:06.170
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys.</b>

11:07.710 --> 11:09.170
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys!</b>

11:12.920 --> 11:13.830
<b>What the-?</b>

11:18.210 --> 11:19.920
<b>Mikuriya-kun's so cool!</b>

11:19.920 --> 11:22.500
<b>Yeah, that equation's so important.</b>

11:22.880 --> 11:25.500
<b>Keep it down! What're you all here for?!</b>

11:25.500 --> 11:28.710
<b>We heard Mikuriya-kun's teaching and came to watch!</b>

11:29.000 --> 11:31.540
<b>Excuse me?! We have to take extra classes
if we mess this up!</b>

11:31.540 --> 11:35.040
<b>We're not in the way. We're just watching!</b>

11:35.040 --> 11:39.750
<b>No matter how many cycles of metempsychosis...
reincarnation I go through,</b>

11:39.750 --> 11:42.920
<b>can I not avoid this fate of mine?!</b>

11:43.210 --> 11:45.040
<b>Silence, imbecile!</b>

11:45.130 --> 11:47.750
<b>I can't concentrate with you lot here!</b>

11:45.670 --> 11:47.540
<b>What's with these people?</b>

11:47.750 --> 11:49.540
<b>I came here just to check, but...</b>

11:49.710 --> 11:51.960
<b>Shut up! It's your fault you can't focus!</b>

11:50.630 --> 11:54.710
<b>How the heck does helping
people study end up like this?!</b>

11:51.960 --> 11:53.540
<b>What did you say?!</b>

11:56.670 --> 11:59.420
<b>What do I do? If this gets any rowdier...</b>

12:00.210 --> 12:01.580
<b>I assume you understand?</b>

12:02.460 --> 12:03.790
<b>I do!</b>

12:03.960 --> 12:06.500
<b>Mikuriya-kun! If this gets any noisier...</b>

12:06.500 --> 12:11.750
<b>Uh, I can't tell you why, but can you do
something about this craziness? Please?!</b>

12:13.130 --> 12:15.830
<b>If it's that important to you, I can't refuse.</b>

12:16.420 --> 12:19.000
<b>Okay! From here on out, it's LA style!</b>

12:19.750 --> 12:21.080
<b>Are you ready?</b>

12:21.920 --> 12:23.630
<b>Yeah!</b>

12:24.330 --> 12:26.250
<b>Repeat after me.</b>

12:26.250 --> 12:27.710
<b>Ripeet afutaa mii!</b>

12:28.420 --> 12:30.000
<b>Go home now.</b>

12:30.000 --> 12:31.710
<b>Go homu nau!</b>

12:32.290 --> 12:35.670
<b>That means, go home immediately.</b>

12:35.670 --> 12:38.210
<b>"Go home immediately"!</b>

12:39.080 --> 12:40.540
<b>Sweet dreams.</b>

12:45.880 --> 12:49.250
<b>Mikuriya-kun... This act you put on sometimes...</b>

12:49.920 --> 12:53.000
<b>What? This is normal in LA.</b>

12:53.830 --> 12:55.960
<b>Safe trip home, everyone!</b>

12:58.750 --> 13:02.540
<b>Wh-why are you watching?!
Um, how long have you been there?</b>

13:07.460 --> 13:11.000
<b>Looks like you're trying hard
to keep the commotion down.</b>

13:11.580 --> 13:13.420
<b>I'm keeping things under control.</b>

13:14.250 --> 13:17.250
<b>You really are the Hero Club's voice of reason.</b>

13:17.250 --> 13:19.500
<b>We have confidence in your abilities.</b>

13:20.330 --> 13:22.790
<b>Please keep up the good work.</b>

13:23.920 --> 13:25.000
<b>Sure...</b>

13:25.710 --> 13:28.080
<b>So the Student Council's always watching?</b>

13:28.500 --> 13:30.920
<b>Then there's no way we can trick them.</b>

13:32.210 --> 13:35.130
<b>That was such a simple job, and it got crazy...</b>

13:36.040 --> 13:40.960
<b>If that was Noda-kun, I don't think I could contain him
no matter how many Hero Tickets I used!</b>

13:42.000 --> 13:45.790
<b>But the Hero Club can't refuse all of the requests it gets...</b>

13:47.790 --> 13:50.250
<b>Mmm... I guess I'll have to be selective.</b>

13:50.460 --> 13:53.420
<b>Caution is a virtue</b>

13:50.460 --> 13:53.420
<b>Toga Ryushoin</b>

13:50.830 --> 13:53.460
<b>Pink! What requests do we have today?</b>

13:53.460 --> 13:56.460
<b>Uh?! W-w-we don't have anything on today!</b>

13:56.580 --> 14:00.460
<b>Huh?! But we had stuff to do every day since Sports Day!</b>

14:02.790 --> 14:05.080
<b>We actually do have one, but...</b>

14:05.670 --> 14:08.170
<b>What did we do wrong?!</b>

14:08.170 --> 14:11.040
<b>It's because we cause a commotion
with everything we do!</b>

14:11.040 --> 14:12.960
<b>Then I'm going home.</b>

14:14.540 --> 14:15.500
<b>Same here.</b>

14:15.710 --> 14:20.500
<b>Oh, I got a load of sweet potatoes.
Let's roast them! On a campfire!</b>

14:22.130 --> 14:24.290
<b>It'll be just like that cooking class incident, for sure!</b>

14:24.670 --> 14:26.710
<b>If we're gonna roast them, we should use an oven!</b>

14:26.710 --> 14:27.710
<b>Huh?!</b>

14:28.500 --> 14:32.960
<b>Smile Recipe</b>

14:28.500 --> 14:32.960
<b>This week:</b>

14:28.500 --> 14:32.960
<b>Sweet potato dessert</b>

14:29.380 --> 14:33.000
<b>Sora-chan's "Smile Recipe"...
This week's is a sweet potato dessert, huh?</b>

14:33.000 --> 14:34.750
<b>I know how to make those.</b>

14:34.750 --> 14:36.080
<b>What, really?!</b>

14:36.290 --> 14:37.500
<b>They're real good.</b>

14:37.710 --> 14:42.080
<b>Then go ahead and use the roasting chamber fabricated
from steel that belongs to my house.</b>

14:42.080 --> 14:43.460
<b>You have an oven?</b>

14:43.460 --> 14:48.000
<b>Indeed. Ifrit fire shall burn everything to a crisp.</b>

14:49.130 --> 14:51.540
<b>I guess it'll be okay if they're in Nakamura-kun's house?</b>

14:52.130 --> 14:53.380
<b>You're coming too, right, Pink?</b>

14:53.380 --> 14:55.830
<b>Er?! Uh, I have something I need to do!</b>

14:55.830 --> 14:57.380
<b>Even though we have no requests?</b>

14:57.380 --> 14:59.540
<b>Um, just a separate thing...</b>

14:59.960 --> 15:01.960
<b>Anyway, I've gotta get going now!</b>

15:02.330 --> 15:04.420
<b>Promise me you won't cause a commotion, okay?!</b>

15:07.920 --> 15:11.330
<b>Please, please, please promise me you won't, okay?!</b>

15:12.040 --> 15:13.250
<b>Huh...?</b>

15:13.920 --> 15:15.830
<b>Pink isn't her usual self.</b>

15:16.130 --> 15:17.920
<b>Her eyes were wandering around the whole time.</b>

15:17.920 --> 15:19.830
<b>And she didn't deny being Pink.</b>

15:20.330 --> 15:22.250
<b>You act like you don't notice, but you do.</b>

15:23.790 --> 15:26.960
<b>Considering she was weirdly persistent
about not causing a commotion,</b>

15:26.960 --> 15:31.420
<b>maybe she's gotten mixed up
in something because of you guys?</b>

15:32.210 --> 15:34.040
<b>Have we done anything?</b>

15:34.330 --> 15:38.460
<b>I can't hide my innate charisma
even if I want to, you know?</b>

15:38.960 --> 15:40.670
<b>You think it's because of what happened on Sports Day?</b>

15:40.670 --> 15:43.670
<b>If it is, I'm at fault here, too.</b>

15:44.130 --> 15:45.330
<b>We've got to do something.</b>

15:45.630 --> 15:47.540
<b>I agree with Green!</b>

15:47.540 --> 15:49.330
<b>Let's all go help Pink out!</b>

15:49.670 --> 15:51.290
<b>Any ideas about what's wrong?</b>

15:52.130 --> 15:54.210
<b>We'll investigate that now.</b>

15:54.920 --> 15:59.290
<b>Rei and Nakamura, stay here and
try to find out what Hijiri's hiding.</b>

15:59.290 --> 16:00.540
<b>We're on it.</b>

16:00.790 --> 16:01.830
<b>What about you guys?</b>

16:02.210 --> 16:03.960
<b>We'll go ask around.</b>

16:03.960 --> 16:04.960
<b>Okay.</b>

16:07.040 --> 16:08.040
<b>Watase!</b>

16:08.040 --> 16:08.540
<b>Oh?</b>

16:08.540 --> 16:10.830
<b>Watase, Watase, Watase, Watase, Watase!</b>

16:11.170 --> 16:13.830
<b>Pink didn't deny being Pink!</b>

16:14.380 --> 16:16.880
<b>Hijiri was acting a bit weird.</b>

16:17.420 --> 16:19.880
<b>We thought you might know something.</b>

16:21.580 --> 16:25.380
<b>I'm not sure, but she did get called
by the Student Council a few times.</b>

16:25.380 --> 16:28.210
<b>The Student Council is the evil Agency?!</b>

16:28.670 --> 16:31.880
<b>So that's why she was so desperate
to keep us from causing a commotion.</b>

16:34.750 --> 16:36.210
<b>So they've returned.</b>

16:36.790 --> 16:39.670
<b>The evil Agency was actually the Student Council!</b>

16:36.790 --> 16:37.500
<b>Ow!</b>

16:39.670 --> 16:40.630
<b>Excuse me?</b>

16:40.790 --> 16:43.500
<b>Apparently she got called by
the Student Council a few times.</b>

16:43.880 --> 16:46.210
<b>Seems like they've been keeping an eye on us.</b>

16:46.210 --> 16:49.130
<b>No more info than that, though. You guys?</b>

16:49.380 --> 16:53.130
<b>We found this. A job request when
she said we didn't have any.</b>

16:53.130 --> 16:54.580
<b>Yamanoshita-cho</b>

16:53.130 --> 16:54.580
<b>Change light bulbs</b>

16:55.000 --> 17:00.630
<b>We deciphered the holy pen impressions
with the power of the wand of black lead.</b>

17:00.790 --> 17:03.630
<b>"Yamanoshita-cho," "change light bulbs."</b>

17:04.080 --> 17:05.830
<b>Why would she hide this?</b>

17:05.830 --> 17:09.170
<b>She probably thought involving
you lot would lead to trouble.</b>

17:09.170 --> 17:13.080
<b>Hey, but Yamanoshita-cho's along the bus route that
ends at 5 PM.</b>

17:13.080 --> 17:14.670
<b>I wonder if she's okay.</b>

17:14.670 --> 17:16.250
<b>How in the world do you know that?</b>

17:16.250 --> 17:19.710
<b>Well, because a Sora-chan themed bus
is running right now.</b>

17:19.710 --> 17:23.540
<b>Plus there are no street lights there, so it gets super dark.</b>

17:24.920 --> 17:26.460
<b>It demands a sacrifice!</b>

17:28.460 --> 17:29.960
<b>Will iLive bread do?</b>

17:28.670 --> 17:32.630
<b>iLive! Cream Bun</b>

17:29.960 --> 17:31.750
<b>Though I've taken the sticker out already.</b>

17:31.750 --> 17:32.670
<b>No!</b>

17:33.460 --> 17:38.460
<b>Legend has it that a monster demanding
a sacrifice lurks in that area!</b>

17:39.540 --> 17:43.380
<b>I finished the job, but who thought
the buses stop at 5 PM?</b>

17:43.880 --> 17:46.000
<b>I should've come on bike...</b>

17:47.130 --> 17:50.920
<b>Huh. There's a pond here. I didn't even notice.</b>

17:50.170 --> 17:51.920
<b>DANGER!</b>

17:51.960 --> 17:54.580
<b>Don't feed the GOLDFISH!</b>

17:52.880 --> 17:53.880
<b>"Goldfish"?</b>

17:55.880 --> 17:56.960
<b>Huh?!</b>

17:58.540 --> 17:59.790
<b>Benjamin!</b>

18:01.670 --> 18:05.330
<b>Those aren't goldfish! Those are aggressive wild carp!</b>

18:06.130 --> 18:07.080
<b>Benjamin!</b>

18:08.290 --> 18:11.170
<b>Here, kitty. That's a good kitty, come on!</b>

18:27.960 --> 18:30.040
<b>Benjamin!</b>

18:30.670 --> 18:32.170
<b>Hold out your paw!</b>

18:34.830 --> 18:35.670
<b>Ow!</b>

18:42.920 --> 18:45.670
<b>I'm gonna die! This is the kind of thing
where people totally die!</b>

18:48.960 --> 18:52.920
<b>Ow, ow! These fins? Scales? They're surprisingly painful!</b>

18:54.380 --> 18:55.670
<b>Can't...hold on...</b>

18:56.080 --> 18:58.580
<b>Somebody! Help!</b>

18:58.580 --> 18:59.540
<b>Sure!</b>

19:04.040 --> 19:05.170
<b>Noda-kun?!</b>

19:05.580 --> 19:07.710
<b>You're safe now, Pink!</b>

19:07.710 --> 19:08.830
<b>Why?!</b>

19:09.710 --> 19:15.330
<b>I promised, remember? That I'd definitely be there
anytime you call for me, Pink!</b>

19:16.250 --> 19:18.130
<b>Hijiri-san, reach out your hand.</b>

19:21.710 --> 19:23.330
<b>Okay, we're gonna pull.</b>

19:23.330 --> 19:25.040
<b>Ready, and...</b>

19:28.290 --> 19:30.000
<b>Yellow, you take care of Pink!</b>

19:30.000 --> 19:30.830
<b>Huh?</b>

19:39.380 --> 19:40.710
<b>Yamato!</b>

19:41.540 --> 19:42.830
<b>Noda-kun!</b>

19:43.170 --> 19:45.830
<b>Vile monsters! Take this!</b>

19:52.750 --> 19:53.880
<b>Noda-kun!</b>

19:56.580 --> 19:58.130
<b>Why are you crying?!</b>

19:58.960 --> 19:59.960
<b>Well...</b>

20:01.750 --> 20:04.250
<b>Thank you... for saving me!</b>

20:06.830 --> 20:11.250
<b>Not to fear. I offered the monsters this sacrifice.</b>

20:11.250 --> 20:12.630
<b>iLive bread...</b>

20:13.040 --> 20:15.170
<b>We found the job request memo in the clubroom.</b>

20:15.580 --> 20:17.540
<b>That's why we all came to get you.</b>

20:18.080 --> 20:20.130
<b>It'll be dark soon. That's dangerous.</b>

20:20.500 --> 20:25.460
<b>I knew as soon as I saw Benjamin soaked with water
that you were in the pond, Hijiri-san.</b>

20:25.460 --> 20:28.250
<b>Who was the one who panicked when the cat jumped you?</b>

20:28.380 --> 20:29.170
<b>Shh!</b>

20:29.330 --> 20:32.250
<b>But Yamato was worried the most.</b>

20:32.580 --> 20:35.420
<b>That's right! You have no need to worry, Pink!</b>

20:35.420 --> 20:36.420
<b>Huh?</b>

20:37.420 --> 20:39.420
<b>We heard the Student Council summoned you?</b>

20:40.000 --> 20:41.380
<b>Uh, yeah...</b>

20:41.380 --> 20:43.790
<b>I can imagine what they must have said.</b>

20:44.290 --> 20:46.670
<b>Don't worry, it'll work out.</b>

20:47.670 --> 20:49.710
<b>We just need to stay quiet, right?</b>

20:49.710 --> 20:51.500
<b>I'll stay quiet, too!</b>

20:53.460 --> 20:54.580
<b>It's that kind of thing!</b>

20:54.580 --> 20:55.670
<b>Stupid!</b>

20:57.500 --> 21:02.380
<b>None of them are normal pretty boys,
and they're weird sometimes,</b>

21:03.130 --> 21:07.000
<b>but... I kind of like them... I guess?</b>

21:08.290 --> 21:09.880
<b>Noda-kun! All of you!</b>

21:11.880 --> 21:14.460
<b>I'm going to join the Hero Club!</b>

21:15.130 --> 21:16.750
<b>Oh, you've made up your mind?</b>

21:17.000 --> 21:19.710
<b>This means you'll be up against the evil
organizations.</b>

21:19.710 --> 21:21.920
<b>You're crazy if that's what you want.</b>

21:22.420 --> 21:23.460
<b>You, too.</b>

21:23.460 --> 21:25.420
<b>Welcome to the club, Pink!</b>

21:26.080 --> 21:28.540
<b>Uh, about that Pink thing, though...</b>

21:28.540 --> 21:30.710
<b>You're back to your usual self, Pink!</b>

21:30.710 --> 21:32.460
<b>Huh? What do you mean?</b>

21:32.960 --> 21:34.330
<b>You really are Pink, Pink!</b>

21:34.330 --> 21:37.880
<b>Huh? What, what, what? I said I'm not Pink!</b>

21:40.380 --> 21:42.880
<b>That area's off limits.</b>

21:43.830 --> 21:47.960
<b>Apparently Mizuki Hijiri isn't fit to keep
the Hero Club under control.</b>

21:48.380 --> 21:49.170
<b>In that case...</b>

21:49.170 --> 21:52.460
<b>Start the preparations we discussed.</b>

21:52.460 --> 21:55.960
<b>Shutdown</b>

22:03.920 --> 22:08.580
<b>A vivid melody shrouded in a seasonal wind</b>

22:08.580 --> 22:11.670
<b>Calls to me</b>

22:11.920 --> 22:19.130
<b>Rhythm overflows, accelerating the sound of footsteps</b>

22:19.540 --> 22:27.380
<b>Let's go look for something we'll never
get with our heads hanging down</b>

22:27.540 --> 22:37.630
<b>If I go with you, I'm sure we can leap over the highest of walls</b>

22:38.040 --> 22:40.330
<b>Let's get started! All right?</b>

22:40.670 --> 22:44.580
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

22:44.580 --> 22:47.790
<b>On those wings you illustrated</b>

22:47.790 --> 22:51.580
<b>Keep flying, and to a story</b>

22:51.830 --> 22:56.460
<b>We'll soar through tomorrow</b>

22:56.460 --> 23:00.580
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

23:00.580 --> 23:03.920
<b>That heartbeat that won't disappear</b>

23:03.920 --> 23:07.830
<b>Keep trying, and to a story</b>

23:07.830 --> 23:11.500
<b>Harmonies overlap</b>

23:11.670 --> 23:17.290
<b>The image of the future that doesn't belong to anyone</b>

23:17.670 --> 23:22.670
<b>I'll draw it, with you</b>

23:27.250 --> 23:29.250
<b>The cultural festival is calling the Hero Club!</b>

23:27.790 --> 23:30.670
<b>Who dares disturb my slumber...?</b>

23:28.540 --> 23:31.210
<b>Call us, and we're there in an instant!</b>

23:29.250 --> 23:31.710
<b>Wait, what's this? A script from the Drama Club?</b>

23:31.710 --> 23:34.080
<b>Yellow's Snow White, and Black's Cinderella!</b>

23:32.040 --> 23:36.040
<b>Theater, hmm? Then I shall play the clown for a short while.</b>

23:34.080 --> 23:36.080
<b>Why am I the prince's white horse?!</b>

23:34.210 --> 23:35.920
<b>Nakamura-kun as Cinderella...?!</b>

23:34.250 --> 23:35.960
<b>But I'm a boy. Are you sure...?</b>

23:34.290 --> 23:35.380
<b>Zawa...zawa...</b>

23:34.460 --> 23:35.330
<b>Boy in a dress</b>

23:34.540 --> 23:35.330
<b>Ba-dump...</b>

23:34.750 --> 23:36.710
<b>Even boys can be princesses!</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:37.830
<b>Takashima as Snow White...</b>

23:36.170 --> 23:39.830
<b>A princess who'll only wake up with a kiss from Sora-chan</b>

23:36.540 --> 23:40.210
<b>Next episode: "Swaying in the Gap
Between Ideals and Reality."</b>

23:37.330 --> 23:39.830
<b>*- He's doomed</b>

23:37.750 --> 23:39.420
<b>*- Break the dimensional wall</b>
